{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Strengthen the hands.</b> According to the view of all the commentators, it refers to the future. And according to the view of Rabbi Moses the Kohen, it concerns those who returned in the days of Hezekiah upon the death of the king of Assyria." "And the meaning of <b>and knees</b> is on account of walking."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:42.480252232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}